B.bbm=s(["Pa gen pwopriyet\xe8 aktif pou sal sa a.","Aucun propri\xe9taire actif pour cette salle.","This gym has no active owner."],t.s)
B.bam=s(["Im\xe8l sa a deja gen yon kont. Chwazi yon l\xf2t im\xe8l; aplikasyon an pa transfere kont ant sal yo.","Cet email poss\xe8de d\xe9j\xe0 un compte. Choisissez un autre email ; l\u2019application ne transf\xe8re pas les comptes entre salles.","This email already has an account. Choose another email; accounts are not transferred between gyms."],t.s)
